Homepage: https://desktop.telegram.org/
Description: Telegram Desktop (unofficial repack of the official arm64 snap)
 Official Telegram Desktop arm64 binary taken from the snap store
 (snap revision @SNAP_REVISION@) and repacked as a .deb, so that it runs
 without snapd. Libraries missing in the target Ubuntu release are bundled
 in /opt/telegram-desktop/libs.
 .
 This package is not built or endorsed by Telegram.
